**Table 2: Summary of RUF usage**

| Type       | RUF Count | Package Versions | RUF Usage Items |
| ---------- | ---------:| ----------------:| ---------------:|
| Accepted   |       382 |           24,681 |          38,858 |
| Active     |       381 |           55,785 |         101,494 |
| Incomplete |         7 |            5,829 |            5,926 |
| Removed    |        41 |           14,812 |          21,096 |
| Unknown    |       189 |           10,534 |          14,652 |
